摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Deterministic fault injection and autonomous resilience tests for DeepSeek Harness tools","id":"gh:1333421368","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-tool-chaos","slug":"cyanseek/dsh-tool-chaos","topics":["agent-skills","agent-testing","chaos-engineering","code-mode","codex-plugin","cordis","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","fault-injection","resilience-testing","tool-pipeline"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Deterministic fault injection and autonomous resilience tests for DeepSeek Harness tools"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-tool-chaos"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> Development version `0.1.0-next.1` (GitHub source; no npm release): tested locally on Windows Node"},{"id":"p3s2","text":".js 24.11.1 with DSH `0.1.7-rc.2` (2026-09-28). Updated ToolCallId integration and TypeScript 7; fau"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"lt injection remains disabled by default. Model-backed end-to-end and native macOS runs have not bee"},{"id":"p3s4","text":"n remains disabled by default. Model-backed end-to-end and native macOS runs have not been repeated."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**English** · 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> Deterministic fault injection and evidence-backed resilience tests for the DeepSeek Harness tool p"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"inistic fault injection and evidence-backed resilience tests for the DeepSeek Harness tool pipeline."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"`dsh-tool-chaos` runs an isolated DSH experiment through **baseline → dry-run → fault injection → PA"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"SS / FAIL / INCONCLUSIVE**. It helps plugin and Agent authors verify retry, fallback, cancellation, "},{"id":"p6s3","text":"policy-denial, and untrusted-result behavior before those paths fail unexpectedly."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Status: **`0.1.0-next.1` development candidate (unreleased)**. DSH is still in developer preview, so"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" pin versions and review the tested compatibility matrix."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Highlights"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- Five DSH-native actions: `deny`, `error`, `delay`, `abort`, and `block`.\n- Reproducible matching a"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"nd sampling; no runtime randomness.\n- Disabled and dry-run by default, with bounded injections and e"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"xplicit global-wildcard opt-in.\n- JSON and Markdown reports with structured decision events and a th"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"ree-state verdict.\n- Native Cordis plugin, zero-runtime-dependency CLI, TypeScript engine API, and C"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"odex/Agent Skill surfaces."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The npm prerelease has not been published yet. The currently available path is a source checkout and"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" a locally built tarball:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"The effective config should contain `tool-chaos` and `tool-chaos-reporter`. Both are inert after ins"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"tallation: the main plugin is disabled and the reporter is disabled."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Generate a complete dry-run overlay:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Review the generated tool matcher, task, and assertion, then run it against the disposable profile:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"A dry-run must show the intended `dryRun: true` decision while leaving tool execution unchanged. Run"},{"id":"p18s2","text":" a real experiment only after that match is exact."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Install from a pinned GitHub commit"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"DSH can install this repository directly:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"pnpm 10+ can intentionally block a Git dependency's `prepare` script. If it does, review the pinned "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"source and copy the **exact package key printed by pnpm** into that profile's `pnpm-workspace.yaml`:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Rerun the install and verify the effective config. This approval allows package code to execute duri"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"ng installation; a reviewed tarball remains the simpler option."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"To uninstall and verify removal:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Installed defaults cannot inject a fault:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"A bounded preview rule looks like this:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"`tool` is an anchored, case-sensitive glob. `argumentsPattern` runs against stable key-sorted JSON. "},{"id":"p32s2","text":"DSH patch rows replace a row's complete `config`, so every overlay must restate all keys it relies o"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"H patch rows replace a row's complete `config`, so every overlay must restate all keys it relies on."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Fault actions"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"| Action | DSH pipeline phase | Behavior |"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"| `deny` | `tools/pre-execute` | Reject before dispatch |\n| `error` | `tools/execute` | Return a str"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"uctured injected error without running the tool body |\n| `delay` | `tools/execute` | Add abort-aware"},{"id":"p35s3","text":" latency |\n| `abort` | `tools/execute` | Abort a derived signal and restore the upstream signal |\n| "},{"id":"p35s4","text":"`block` | `tools/post-execute` | Run the tool, then withhold its result |"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Each decision emits `tool-chaos/decision`. The optional reporter converts it to a stable stderr JSON"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"L boundary prefixed with `DSH_TOOL_CHAOS_EVENT `."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## Evidence and verdicts"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"The CLI writes a JSON source-of-truth report and a Markdown summary. Reports include configuration h"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"ashes, bounded process metadata, parsed chaos decisions, assertions, verdict, and a reproduction com"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"mand. Raw command output is excluded unless explicitly requested."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"| Verdict | Meaning |"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"| `PASS` | The intended fault occurred and the declared recovery behavior is supported by evidence |"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"\n| `FAIL` | The intended fault occurred and at least one recovery assertion failed |\n| `INCONCLUSIVE"},{"id":"p40s3","text":"` | Baseline, installation, matching, safety, or observation evidence is incomplete |"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"Exit code alone is never sufficient evidence of resilience."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"## CLI"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"Automation should consume `--json` instead of scraping human-readable output."},{"id":"p45s1","text":"## Codex and Agent Skill"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"The repository contains a Codex marketplace plugin and an open Agent Skill. Install the Codex plugin"},{"id":"p46s2","text":"ntains a Codex marketplace plugin and an open Agent Skill. Install the Codex plugin from a checkout:"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"Start a new thread and invoke:"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"See Codex integration for the source-checkout workflow. `npx dsh-tool-chaos ...` commands become ava"},{"id":"p50s2","text":"ilable only after the npm prerelease is published."},{"id":"p51s1","text":"## Programmatic engine"},{"id":"p52s1","text":"The `dsh-tool-chaos/engine` export has no Cordis or DSH runtime import:"},{"id":"p53s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p54s1","text":"See the engine example."},{"id":"p55s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p56s1","text":"| Surface | Verified state |"},{"id":"p57s1","text":"| Tests | Strict TypeScript compile and 32 unit/CLI/real-runtime tests pass |\n| Node | 24.11.1 local"},{"id":"p57s2","text":"ly; GitHub CI passes on 22.19.0 and 24.x |\n| DSH development snapshot | `@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools@0.1."},{"id":"p57s3","text":"7-rc.2` runtime integration and all 32 tests pass on Windows Node 24.11.1 (September 28, 2026) |\n| T"},{"id":"p57s4","text":"arball consumer | Install, repeated add, config dump, and read-only headless dry-run preview pass |\n"},{"id":"p57s5","text":"| GitHub source | Pinned commit install, repeated install, config dump, uninstall, and reinstall pas"},{"id":"p57s6","text":"s with pnpm 11.7.0 |\n| npm | Not published; no npm availability claim is made |"},{"id":"p58s1","text":"Evidence was collected on August 14, 2026 with isolated profiles and synthetic read-only input. See "},{"id":"p58s2","text":"Compatibility for the precise matrix and limitations."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
